### 5. Deployment Step-by-Step on Web Server

Log into your server via SSH:

#### Step 5.1: Create Project Directories & Permissions
```bash
sudo mkdir -p /var/www/ftdcare/{html,app,config}
sudo chown -R $USER:$USER /var/www/ftdcare
```

#### Step 5.2: Configure PostgreSQL 16
```bash
sudo -u postgres psql
```
In the `psql` console, run:
```sql
CREATE DATABASE ftdcare_db;
CREATE USER ftdcare_user WITH ENCRYPTED PASSWORD 'YOUR_STRONG_POSTGRES_PASSWORD';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE ftdcare_db TO ftdcare_user;
ALTER DATABASE ftdcare_db OWNER TO ftdcare_user;
\q
```

#### Step 5.3: Create `/var/www/ftdcare/config/ftdcare.env`
```bash
nano /var/www/ftdcare/config/ftdcare.env
```
Paste your configuration from **Section 2** and secure the permissions:
```bash
chmod 600 /var/www/ftdcare/config/ftdcare.env
```

#### Step 5.4: Build the Vite Frontend into `html/`
Clone your repository into a temporary workspace or your home directory:
```bash
cd ~
git clone https://github.com/IsmayilAbdullazada/FTD.git ftd-build
cd ftd-build
npm install
```

Build the Vite static assets:
```bash
npm run build
```
Copy the compiled distribution files to `/var/www/ftdcare/html/`:
```bash
cp -r dist/* /var/www/ftdcare/html/
```

#### Step 5.5: Deploy and Compile the Backend in `app/`
Copy the backend code into `/var/www/ftdcare/app/`:
```bash
cd /var/www/ftdcare/app
# Initialize files as structured in Section 4
npm install
npm run build

# Run database migration and initial seeds
npm run migrate
npm run seed
```

#### Step 5.6: Manage Node.js with Systemd (Production Service)
Create a systemd unit file using Node 24’s native `--env-file` parameter:

```bash
sudo nano /etc/systemd/system/ftdcare.service
```

Paste the following:
```ini
[Unit]
Description=FTD Care Partner Connect Backend Service
After=network.target postgresql.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=www-data
WorkingDirectory=/var/www/ftdcare/app
EnvironmentFile=/var/www/ftdcare/config/ftdcare.env
ExecStart=/usr/bin/node dist/server.js
Restart=always
RestartSec=5
StandardOutput=syslog
StandardError=syslog
SyslogIdentifier=ftdcare-app

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

Give `www-data` ownership of the application directory and start the service:
```bash
sudo chown -R www-data:www-data /var/www/ftdcare/app /var/www/ftdcare/html
sudo chmod 640 /var/www/ftdcare/config/ftdcare.env

sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable ftdcare
sudo systemctl start ftdcare
sudo systemctl status ftdcare
```

